@startuml
title Hybrid Recommendation Module : View Personalised Travel Recommendations

actor "Traveller" as Actor
participant UI as ":recommendationUI"
participant Ctrl as ":recommendationController"
database DB as ":firebaseFirestore"

Actor -> UI: Open Hybrid Recommendation Module
Actor -> UI: Select View Personalised Recommendations
UI -> Ctrl: Request existing recommendations
Ctrl -> DB: retrieveRecord(travelPreference)
DB --> Ctrl: Preference profile

alt [Travel preference questionnaire is incomplete]
    Ctrl --> UI: Prompt traveller to complete the preference questionnaire
else [Preference profile is available]
    Ctrl -> DB: retrieveRecord(recommendationResults)
    DB --> Ctrl: Recommendation results

    alt [Personalised recommendations are available]
        Ctrl --> UI: Display recommendation list and available suitability information
    else [No recommendation has been generated]
        Ctrl --> UI: Prompt traveller to generate recommendations
    end
end
@enduml
